{{!
    @template tool_vae/selfposition_page

    The page of the self-positioning, under its title, in one of three states: the competencies switched off (a
    notification); the tree of a record between its code and the way back; one node, with the errors of a send, the node
    and its annotations.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\selfposition_page. The template holds no logic.
    Every value is escaped (double braces) except these keys:
    * noticehtml, errorhtml, noteerrorhtml - notifications drawn by the renderer of the core ('' for none)
    * treehtml - the tree, drawn by the template tool_vae/selfpos_record_tree
    * nodehtml - the node, drawn by the template tool_vae/selfpos_node
    * noteshtml - the annotations, drawn by the template tool_vae/notes_block ('' for none)

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * disabled - object or null: noticehtml
    * tree - object or null: code (the code of the record), treehtml, back (url, text)
    * node - object or null: errorhtml, noteerrorhtml, nodehtml, noteshtml

    Example context (json):
    {
        "disabled": {"noticehtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-danger\">The competencies are switched off.</div>"},
        "tree": {
            "code": "RNCP100",
            "treehtml": "<ul class=\"list-unstyled\"><li>BC01</li></ul>",
            "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/organisation.php?tab=mine", "text": "Back to my pathway"}
        },
        "node": {
            "errorhtml": "",
            "noteerrorhtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-danger\">Too long.</div>",
            "nodehtml": "<div class=\"tool-vae-selfpos\">C01</div>",
            "noteshtml": "<section class=\"tool-vae-notes mt-4\"></section>"
        }
    }
}}
{{#disabled}}{{{noticehtml}}}{{/disabled}}{{!
}}{{#tree}}<p><strong>{{code}}</strong></p>{{{treehtml}}}{{#back}}<p><a href="{{url}}">{{text}}</a></p>{{/back}}{{/tree}}{{!
}}{{#node}}{{{errorhtml}}}{{{noteerrorhtml}}}{{{nodehtml}}}{{{noteshtml}}}{{/node}}
